rver's own renderer (`apps/server/src/telegram/card.ts`).\n\n| File | Moment |\n| --- | --- |\n| 01-host-words.jpg | The photo developed, six words from the model |\n| 01-host-send.jpg | Send it: how many it needs, what's near |\n| 01-host-sent.jpg | Sent |\n| 02-friend-invite.jpg | The friend's invite |\n| 03-friend-lit.jpg, 03-host-lit.jpg | It's lit, on both phones |\n| 04-friend-compass.jpg | Find them: distance and spoken direction |\n| 05-friend-spark.jpg | Leaving a Spark |\n| 06-friend-ember.jpg, 06-host-ember.jpg | 30 minutes without enough yeses: the smaller plan |\n| 07-telegram-card-kindling.png, 07-telegram-card-lit.png | The Telegram card, Kindling and Lit |\n\nStill to add: [FIELD] photos from the field test, and the iPhone screen recording from [shot-list.md](../shot-list.md).\n","userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e6e6011-0cc0-42f1-a5c5-22d83a5b954c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
