{"parentUuid":"3410c8ef-8d27-4088-841a-2a1e25236aa7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw3SdHaWFfD57VFPorDX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FRqRMnQgppr3W92NEhP82V","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git add apps/web/src apps/web/test/e2e/demo.ts design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json docs/content \"apps/web/src/routes/(site)\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFresh-eyes round 4 fixes (6/10): a demo whose counts add up\n\n- Demo: after Skip 30 min, the smaller plan lights with the yeses\n  already in; Benny's yes comes only if it is still short, so \"here\"\n  and the faces match the count. The bench is at the spot (no \"40 m\"\n  against a 150 m compass).\n- Demo condition: the real read-back with Yes, I'm in and Fix it, then\n  \"You're in if: Back by 5 PM\" (no doubled \"Got it ... Right?\").\n- Demo exit: back only when you came from this site, else home (a\n  fresh tab no longer lands on about:blank).\n- Finishing the demo counts as the intro: Light a Flare goes straight\n  to the app, not three more slides.\n- Send: \"Add where you are to send it.\" under an empty place; Edit\n  keeps the line you see instead of an empty box.\n- Copy: placeholders no longer name demo characters (\"e.g. Sam\",\n  \"after 2, back by 5, 10 min walk at most\"); the tip's button is\n  \"Dismiss tip\", so two buttons aren't both \"Close\"; the site header\n  is solid while scrolling.\ndemo e2e covers the read-back; unit 682/63/26; axe 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"; node scripts/capture-media.ts 2>&1 | tail -1; cp docs/design/redesign/after/demo-2a-friend.jpg docs/post/media/11-demo-friend-view.jpg; cp docs/design/redesign/after/demo-4-compass.jpg docs/post/media/04b-demo-compass-ahead.jpg; git status --short docs/post | head","description":"Commit,