{"parentUuid":"e5f00b3b-69d5-461d-9555-1adb4d896d4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw3jysYKEV4KJetikF61","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014qnMNMY4WMM7mEhjJXCYbN","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Round 4 fixed and live; media recaptured","message":"Fresh-eyes round 4 scored 6/10. Its main findings are fixed and live as 6fdc40d: the demo e2e passes against the live URL, and smoke passes every required check.\n\n**Fixed:**\n- **Demo counts now add up.** After Skip 30 min, the smaller plan lights with the yeses already in. Benny's yes only comes if it's still short, so \"here\" and the faces match the count. The bench is at the spot, which removes the \"40 m\" vs \"150 m compass\" clash.\n- **The condition gets a real read-back** with \"Yes, I'm in\" and \"Fix it\", then \"You're in if: Back by 5 PM\". The doubled \"Got it … Right?\" is gone. The demo e2e now covers this path.\n- **The demo's exit** goes back only if you came from this site. Otherwise it goes home, so a fresh tab no longer lands on about:blank.\n- **Finishing the demo counts as the intro.** \"Light a Flare\" goes straight to the app with no extra slides.\n- **Send:**\n  - an empty place now shows the hint \"Add where you are to send it.\";\n  - Edit keeps the line you see instead of opening an empty box.\n- **Copy and markup:**\n  - placeholders no longer name the demo characters (\"e.g. Sam\", \"after 2, back by 5, 10 min walk at most\");\n  - the tip button is now \"Dismiss tip\", so two buttons aren't both named \"Close\";\n  - the site header is solid when you scroll.\n\n**Checks:** unit 682/63/26. e2e passes for demo, sparks, plan and loop. axe 0 on 88 views.\n\n**Post:** media recaptured with capture-media.ts, all shots consistent. The post's tester row now reads 5, 6, 5 and 6 out of 10. The open items are logged in docs/research (compass arrow, two mute controls, menu size, \"Use my words\" while drafting, place pre-fill, a desktop \"best on your phone\" note).\n\nIt's 4:05 PM. Unless you want something else, I'll use the time before 8 PM for the cheap leftovers (enabling \"Use my words\" while it drafts, a rotating compass arrow) and keep the post and media in sync.","type":"message","recipient":"uds:<socket>","recipient_kind":"session","content":"Fresh-eyes round 4 scored 6/10. Its main findings…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":711818,"output_tokens":851,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":851,"cache_read_input_tokens":711818,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014qnMNMY4WMM7mEhjJXCYbN":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Round 4 fixed and live; media recaptured","message":"Fresh-eyes round 4 scored 6/10. Its main findings are fixed and live as 6fdc40d: the demo e2e passes against the live URL, and smoke passes every required check.\n\n**Fixed:**\n- **Demo counts now add up.** After Skip 30 min, the smaller plan lights with the yeses already in. Benny's yes only comes if it's still short, so \"here\" and the faces match the count. The bench is at the spot, which removes the \"40 m\" vs \"150 m compass\" clash.\n- **The condition gets a real read-back** with \"Yes, I'm in\" and \"Fix it\", then \"You're in if: Back by 5 PM\". The doubled \"Got it … Right?\" is gone. The demo e2e now covers this path.\n- **The demo's exit** goes back only if you came from this site. Otherwise it goes home, so a fresh tab no longer lands on about:blank.\n- **Finishing the demo counts as the intro.** \"Light a Flare\" goes straight to the app with no extra slides.\n- **Send:**\n  - an empty place now shows the hint \"Add where you are to send it.\";\n  - Edit keeps the line you see instead of opening an empty box.\n- **Copy and markup:**\n  - placeholders no longer name the demo characters (\"e.g. Sam\", \"after 2, back by 5, 10 min walk at most\");\n  - the tip button is now \"Dismiss tip\", so two buttons aren't both named \"Close\";\n  - the site header is solid when you scroll.\n\n**Checks:** unit 682/63/26. e2e passes for demo, sparks, plan and loop. axe 0 on 88 views.\n\n**Post:** media recaptured with capture-media.ts, all shots consistent. The post's tester row now reads 5, 6, 5 and 6 out of 10. The open items are logged in docs/research (compass arrow, two mute controls, menu size, \"Use my words\" while drafting, place pre-fill, a desktop \"best on your phone\" note).\n\nIt's 4:05 PM. Unless you want something else, I'll use the time before 8 PM for the cheap leftovers (enabling \"Use my words\" while it drafts, a rotating compass arrow) and keep the post and media in sync."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"32f637f2-6df3-4323-861b-f1ceb60b66c9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw3jxd93KiFdRMsJXKGV","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e830176-141c-403b-a53d-99a0c0c35cfe","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:03:35.983Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
