{"parentUuid":"df510858-225a-40d6-8887-2c5ac5fd5519","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>11387015 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2c2107eb-f1a2-4ab2-abca-ddc0edb35838","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:03:37.130Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>11387015 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"2c2107eb-f1a2-4ab2-abca-ddc0edb35838","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw3km8cHyRxXcNXUA2Tp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fresh-eyes round 4 scored 6/10 (rounds 1 to 3: 5, 6, 5). I fixed most of what it found, and that's live as 6fdc40d. The demo test passes against the live site, and so does the smoke check.\n\n**What I fixed:**\n- **The demo's counts now add up.** When the plan shrinks, it lights with the people who already said yes. A third friend joins only if it's still short, so \"3 of you are here\" can't appear out of nowhere. The bench is at the meeting spot, so the \"40 m\" shown on one screen no longer clashes with the compass saying 150 m.\n- **Adding a condition shows a real confirm step.** It shows \"Yes, I'm in\" and \"Fix it\", then \"You're in if: Back by 5 PM\". The demo test now covers this path.\n- **The demo's close button** goes home when the demo was opened from a link, instead of a blank page.\n- **Finishing the demo skips the three intro slides** when you go on to the real app.\n- **The Send screen:** a greyed-out Send it now says why (\"Add where you are to send it.\"). Edit keeps the place you see instead of emptying the box.\n- **Smaller fixes:**\n  - placeholders no longer use the demo characters' names;\n  - two buttons on one screen were both named \"Close\", and the tip's is now \"Dismiss tip\";\n  - the website header no longer lets text show through when you scroll.\n\nI recaptured the post screenshots afterwards and they're all consistent. The post now lists the tester scores as 5, 6, 5 and 6 out of 10. All unit and e2e tests pass, and the accessibility check still finds 0 issues.\n\n**Still open, logged in `docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md`:**\n- The compass shows rings and a flame but no arrow that turns.\n- \"Mute sounds\" and \"Mute voice\" sit on the same screen and look like duplicates.\n- The menu has 10 items, and two share an icon.\n- \"Use my words\" stays greyed out while Gemma is still writing.\n- The app doesn't fill in your place from your location on the Send screen.\n- On desktop, nothing suggests opening it on a phone.\n\nNext I plan to do the quick ones before the 8 PM target: letting \"Use my words\" work while Gemma writes, and adding a turning compass arrow. I'll keep the post and screenshots in sync as I go. Your items from before still stand: the [FIELD] spots in the post, making the repo public, DigitalOcean billing and the Google billing decision."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":712289,"output_tokens":838,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":838,"cache_read_input_tokens":712289,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"af86e3fa-7e40-46c9-b805-ece248f96e26","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw3kjeZAeAsJAYiuCaXR","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b63641d-7f7e-4036-a67f-98ff705f0025","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:03:46.477Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:03:50.343Z","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"uds:<socket>\" from-session=\"local_beb3cc8c-e162-46cc-bd0a-f870e8717ebd\" hop-chain=\"e1bd9b33a07bd8c38e68ae6a,d6d9bf2e945799a80139a5bf\" from-name=\"Flare Manager(founders CTO)\" from-mode=\"prompting\">\nApproved. Yes, use the time until 8 PM on the leftovers, in this order:\n1. **The rotating compass arrow.** The founder's first complaint was the compass, so it has to feel right. Smooth rotation from the guide output, with a clear \"facing\" lock-in. Test it against both real iPhone streams.\n2. **One mute control,** not two.\n3. **\"Use my words\"** enabled while the draft is still writing.\n4. **Pre-fill the place** from the map pack.\n5. **Menu size.**\n6. **A desktop \"best on your phone\" note,** with a QR code to open it on a phone.\n\nRedeploy after 1 to 3, and again at the end. Keep the post and media in sync. Around 7:30 PM, run one last fresh-eyes round (round 5) so the post reports the final score honestly. Then stop and hold for the founder's review at 9.\n</cross-session-message>"}
