{"parentUuid":"92d8924d-191c-45cd-aa47-8e7ef6222a70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw47wG9d5QnweDsLojxm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JH5QvsuQwyjDpLXrGnugKt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git add apps/web/src apps/web/test && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nCompass arrow, one mute control, Write my own while drafting\n\n- Compass: an arrowhead on the dial's edge turns with the needle on\n  the same 530 ms spring, against a fixed mark at the top for where\n  the phone points; facing (lock at 15°, release at 25°) turns both\n  gold. Replayed on both real iPhone heading streams against a target\n  300 m away: under 30° per 100 ms event, never the long way round,\n  facing steady. The only bigger steps follow sensor gaps (0.5 to\n  14.5 s, the screen locked), which the spring animates.\n- One mute control: the sound button mutes tones and the spoken\n  directions together, and cancels a line mid-word; the separate\n  Mute voice button is gone.\n- While Gemma writes, Write my own is one tap away; a late draft\n  never replaces words the host already chose or overrides the\n  typing view.\ne2e: sparks, telegram, demo, loop, voice, flow real 2/2; unit pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"; date","description":"Commit 1-3; push; deploy","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":680,"cache_read_input_tokens":733352,"output_tokens":581,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":680,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"inpu