{"parentUuid":"cd3c7836-6524-402b-aa76-5a52e5316b16","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw4sF3uuMyHfJKmcXuoF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01K3dLZf6hQXgj2NHQK27cmg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git add apps/web package.json package-lock.json design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json docs/content && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nPlace pre-fill, a smaller first menu, and a desktop QR note\n\n- Place pre-fill: a position that arrives before the map pack gets\n  its place name when the pack loads, so Send is filled in instead\n  of asking where you are; a typed place is kept. Two flow tests.\n- Menu: with no crew yet it shows 5 items, not 10 (the crew pages\n  and the device check wait for a crew); Your crew has its own\n  people icon; the hidden pause between a row's title and line is\n  a comma, not a stray dot. The group record is reactive ($state.raw),\n  so the menu updates once the crew loads.\n- Desktop: beside the phone column, \"Made for your phone\" and a QR\n  code for this page, drawn locally by uqr 0.1.3 (MIT, no deps),\n  loaded only on screens 1000 px and wider; phones load none of it.\nJS /app 146.8 KB, /g/ 145.9 KB; axe 0 on 88 views; Lighthouse 100;\nunit and e2e pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"; date","description":"Commit 4-6; push; deploy","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":971,"cache_read_input_tokens":751169,"output_tokens":618,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":971,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"g