{"parentUuid":"ccf8e53f-99d4-4468-ade2-7a195c6e2d3a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw4xtJufwf9T2LnzDhxz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DwTcmCEJR4UEPP33oqFJdz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && sed -n 18,20p docs/post/draft.md","description":"Read the compass paragraph"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":752140,"output_tokens":759,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":432},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":708,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":752140,"cache_creation_input_tokens":708,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":708},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01DwTcmCEJR4UEPP33oqFJdz":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && sed -n 18,20p docs/post/draft.md","description":"Read the compass paragraph"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b3597454-2732-4915-951e-29fe6859d7c5","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011Cfw4xs4FTU147UAU89zdq","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e7f307ae-708d-41d6-809b-904bc51645e3","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:19:38.341Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"e7f307ae-708d-41d6-809b-904bc51645e3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a6f088e1-59c1-4e13-9a46-9b61ce690437","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DwTcmCEJR4UEPP33oqFJdz","type":"tool_result","content":"Flare starts there. You take a photo of where you are. Gemma 4, an open model on our own laptop, writes the invite: \"Meet by the quiet water's edge\". Your friends get a link and tap **I'm in**, in private. Everyone sees the count, never who. It goes ahead only if enough people can come. If not enough say yes in 30 minutes, it shrinks to a smaller plan, such as 15 minutes at a bench nearby, instead of dying.\n\nNow picture the friend with low vision. Gemma has already turned the photo into a line their screen reader speaks: \"A calm body of water reflecting trees and distant hills, with reeds and foliage in the foreground.\" When it lights, the compass talks them in: \"150 meters, slightly left.\" It buzzes and sounds a tone when they face the right way. If a photo isn't possible, they *say* where they are, and Gemma writes the invite from their voice.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"caa16a8c-ffe3-4395-a75f-edc8ce063f65","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:19:39.490Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"Flare starts there. You take a photo of where you are. Gemma 4, an open model on our own laptop, writes the invite: \"Meet by the quiet water's edge\". Your friends get a link and tap **I'm in**, in private. Everyone sees the count, never who. It goes ahead only if enough people can come. If not enough say yes in 30 minutes, it shrinks to a smaller plan, such as 15 minutes at a bench nearby, instead of dying.\n\nNow picture the friend with low vision. Gemma has already turned the photo into a line their screen reader speaks: \"A calm body of water reflecting trees and distant hills, with reeds and foliage in the foreground.\" When it lights, the compass talks them in: \"150 meters, slightly left.\" It buzzes and sounds a tone when they face the right way. If a photo isn't possible, they *say* where they are, and Gemma writes the invite from their voice.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b3597454-2732-4915-951e-29fe6859d7c5","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":22,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e7f307ae-708d-41d6-809b-904bc51645e3","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"ccf8e53f-99d4-4468-ade2-7a195c6e2d3a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a6f088e1-59c1-4e13-9a46-9b61ce690437","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TuSMkXWgCigGddktoep1w4","type":"tool_result","content":"20:Now picture the friend with low vision. Gemma has already turned the photo into a line their screen reader speaks: \"A calm body of water reflecting trees and distant hills, with reeds and foliage in the foreground.\" When it lights, the compass talks them in: \"150 meters, slightly left.\" It buzzes and sounds a tone when they face the right way. If a photo isn't possible, they *say* where they are, and Gemma writes the invite from their voice.\n33:| A compass with a warm voice | ElevenLabs clips recorded once, offline | [698 characters, nothing sent](#a-voice-that-sends-nothing-elevenlabs) |\n38:- **Try it with no setup:** [flare-outside.onrender.com/app/demo/](https://flare-outside.onrender.com/app/demo/). The real rules engine runs in your browser with three demo friends, and nothing is sent. Become your friend Amor for one tap, skip 30 minutes to watch it shrink, then follow the compass.\n56:| Real phones | A device-check page on an iPhone 16 Pro Max and an iPhone 13, covering the compass, haptics and sound | 3 bugs found and fixed (below) |\n112:The compass talks, and the phone's own voice can sound flat. A live voice would have had to send the spot's name to a cloud service. So I recorded 54 fixed lines once with **ElevenLabs**: distances, directions, and \"You're close. Look around.\" That cost 698 characters of the free 10,000, and the lines ship with the app as 684 KB of MP3. They hold no names or places and work offline, and the phone's own voice is the fallback.\n146:- **The compass said \"close\" 49 times** on an iPhone 16 Pro Max walk. It now holds a margin and repeats only when the distance halves.\n147:- **The compass froze on an exact 180° turn.** The two directions averaged to nothing. It's fixed with shortest-arc smoothing.\n178:- **ElevenLabs:** a warm compass voice recorded once that sends nothing, and Scribe for a person's own 10-second Spark. [Details](#a-voice-that-sends-nothing-elevenlabs)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"77c41b13-596b-4861-82e9-aa67ca79c46d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:19:39.494Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"20:Now picture the friend with low vision. Gemma has already turned the photo into a line their screen reader speaks: \"A calm body of water reflecting trees and distant hills, with reeds and foliage in the foreground.\" When it lights, the compass talks them in: \"150 meters, slightly left.\" It buzzes and sounds a tone when they face the right way. If a photo isn't possible, they *say* where they are, and Gemma writes the invite from their voice.\n33:| A compass with a warm voice | ElevenLabs clips recorded once, offline | [698 characters, nothing sent](#a-voice-that-sends-nothing-elevenlabs) |\n38:- **Try it with no setup:** [flare-outside.onrender.com/app/demo/](https://flare-outside.onrender.com/app/demo/). The real rules engine runs in your browser with three demo friends, and nothing is sent. Become your friend Amor for one tap, skip 30 minutes to watch it shrink, then follow the compass.\n56:| Real phones | A device-check page on an iPhone 16 Pro Max and an iPhone 13, covering the compass, haptics and sound | 3 bugs found and fixed (below) |\n112:The compass talks, and the phone's own voice can sound flat. A live voice would have had to send the spot's name to a cloud service. So I recorded 54 fixed lines once with **ElevenLabs**: distances, directions, and \"You're close. Look around.\" That cost 698 characters of the free 10,000, and the lines ship with the app as 684 KB of MP3. They hold no names or places and work offline, and the phone's own voice is the fallback.\n146:- **The compass said \"close\" 49 times** on an iPhone 16 Pro Max walk. It now holds a margin and repeats only when the distance halves.\n147:- **The compass froze on an exact 180° turn.** The two directions averaged to nothing. It's fixed with shortest-arc smoothing.\n178:- **ElevenLabs:** a warm compass voice recorded once that sends nothing, and Scribe for a person's own 10-second Spark. [Details](#a-voice-that-sends-nothing-elevenlabs)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"b3597454-2732-4915-951e-29fe6859d7c5","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"<project>/flare","root":"<project>/flare","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":22,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":2},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/flare","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"<project>/flare","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ccf8e53f-99d4-4468-ade2-7a195c6e2d3a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
