{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:22:37.315Z","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"uds:<socket>\" from-session=\"local_beb3cc8c-e162-46cc-bd0a-f870e8717ebd\" hop-chain=\"e1bd9b33a07bd8c38e68ae6a,d6d9bf2e945799a80139a5bf,e1bd9b33a07bd8c38e68ae6a,d6d9bf2e945799a80139a5bf\" from-name=\"Flare Manager(founders CTO)\" from-mode=\"prompting\">\nYes, run round 5 now. Fix what it finds, redeploy, update the post with the final score and recapture any changed shots. Then do a final pre-review pass:\n- CI and every e2e on main\n- smoke on live\n- check-env (no secrets in the repo or the build)\n- `scan-sessions --public` dry run, reporting the email count, for the founder's scrub decision\n- a short `docs/post/REVIEW.md` for the founder: what to fill in, what to upload, the exact publish steps, and the DevRelay submit steps\n\nThen hold.\n</cross-session-message>"}
{"parentUuid":"7d1d01ce-a588-4066-98d1-2743d851d820","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw5CDBaotjoS8E2NSnge","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six follow-ups from round 4 are done and live as 376115a. The demo test passes against the live site, and so does the smoke check.\n\n1. **The compass now points.** An arrowhead on the dial's edge turns smoothly toward your friend, and a fixed mark at the top shows where the phone is facing. When they line up, both turn gold. I replayed the heading data recorded on your iPhone 16 Pro Max and iPhone 13, aimed at a friend 300 m away. The arrow moved less than 30° per sensor reading and never swung the long way round. The only bigger jumps came after the sensor paused, for example while the screen was locked, and those are animated.\n2. **One mute button.** The sound button at the top now silences the tones and the spoken directions together, even mid-sentence. The separate \"Mute voice\" button is gone.\n3. **\"Write my own\" while Gemma is writing.** You can type your own invite without waiting. A draft that arrives late won't replace words you've already chosen.\n4. **Your place fills in on Send.** If your location arrived before the map data had loaded, the place was left blank. It now fills in once the map loads, and a place you typed stays as it is.\n5. **A smaller menu for newcomers.** Without a crew it shows 5 items instead of 10. \"Your crew\" has its own icon, and screen readers no longer read a stray dot in each item.\n6. **A desktop note.** Beside the app on a wide screen: \"Made for your phone\", with a QR code to open the page there. It's drawn locally by a small open-source library (uqr), and phones never load it.\n\nThe full test suite passes, the accessibility check still finds 0 issues, and Lighthouse is still 100 on every site page. The post and its screenshots are updated: a new compass-arrow entry in \"What I got wrong\", plus a fresh compass shot and the desktop note.\n\nThe manager scheduled the final fresh-eyes round for 7:30 PM. I've proposed running it now instead, so there's time to fix what it finds before 8 PM, and the post can still report the final score honestly. I'm holding with no changes to the live site until the manager answers. After that round I'll stop for your 9 PM review."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1299,"cache_read_input_tokens":757283,"output_tokens":711,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1299,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":711,"cache_read_input_tokens":757283,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1299,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1299},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"dad7ebf8-18e6-4640-9c61-a0ae0c4fb5d2","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw5CC3cjF1hzV9AxND2Q","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f23d1e13-4f0e-41ea-b44a-0d34c843c9a6","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:22:38.026Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
