{"parentUuid":"ca9c792d-5ea2-4450-92d3-60920687a5d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw8vMJG7iCPcCcjJzoVN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Uj1vtmtTDDckVh7reiKMW2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git add apps/web/src apps/web/test scripts/capture-media.ts design/prototype/src/lib/copy/deck.json docs/content && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFresh-eyes round 5 fixes (6/10): who you are, and what to tap next\n\n- Demo: a steady \"You: Fuego, the host\" or \"You: Amor, a friend\" line\n  under the badge on every step; coach lines for the second half (\"Not\n  enough said yes, so it shrank. Tap Find them.\" and \"It points to the\n  bench. Tap I'm here when you arrive.\"); the friend's Done reads Back\n  to you, and You made it reads Next (I4 and I8 take a label).\n- Copy: \"Use this\" (one line), \"No bench or restroom info here\",\n  \"Host your own\" in the site nav, the home example names a third\n  friend (\"only if Sam comes\").\nUnit, e2e (demo, sparks, telegram, plan, flow real) and axe 0 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"; node scripts/capture-media.ts 2>&1 | tail -1; cp docs/design/redesign/after/demo-2a-friend.jpg docs/post/media/11-demo-friend-view.jpg; cp docs/design/redesign/after/demo-4-compass.jpg docs/post/media/04b-demo-compass-ahead.jpg; python3 - <<'EOF'\np='docs/post/draft.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold='| Strangers | A tester with no context on the live site, 4 rounds | 5, 6, 5 and 6 out of 10; what each round found was fixed and redeployed |'\nassert old in s\ns=s.replace(old,'| Strangers | A tester with no context on the live site, 5 rounds | 5, 6, 5, 6 and 6 out of 10. What each round found was fixed and redeployed; the last round\\'s fixes went out after its score |')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='docs/post/REVIEW.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('Fresh-eyes testers scored 5, 6, 5, 6 and [round 5]. The post states the final score.','Fresh-eyes testers scored 5, 6, 5, 6 and 6 (five rounds, a new tester with no context each time). The post states this honestly; round 5\\\\'s fixes shipped after its score, so there is no score for them yet.')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Round 5 (6/10, on 376115a, the last round)\nFixed after it:\n- **Who you are.** The demo now shows who you are on every step (\"You: Fuego, the host\" or \"You: Amor, a friend\").\n- **What to tap.** There are coach lines for the shrink and the compass.\n- **Clearer buttons.** \"Back to you\" and \"Next\" replace \"Pocket it\" in the demo.\n- **Copy.** \"Use this\"; \"No bench or restroom info here\"; \"Host your own\"; the home example now names a third friend.\n\nLeft:\n- the host line on your own screen is in the third person (\"Test is waiting at West Road\");\n- the suggested park vs the street name at the spot;\n- the X on the demo's last screens;\n- buttons kept in the DOM behind the demo coach card;\n- \"Sent a moment ago\" never updates;\n- a gap above \"What it does\".\nEOF\ngit add docs/post docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md && git commit -q -m \"Post: final tester score (5 rounds), media recaptured; round 5 recorded\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git push -q 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Commit, deploy, recapture, post score, research note","timeout":1500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":679,"cache_read_input_tokens":789427,"output_tokens":1476,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":679,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inferen