{"parentUuid":"2711d28e-5baf-4d32-a937-0beefdcf660a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw9H3vpCGDvovaz2aaPS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JhSLEREEJ9ofBkRXp2PhP8","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Round 5 fixed, pre-review pass done; holding","message":"Round 5 and the pre-review pass are done. I'm holding for the founder.\n\n**Round 5: 6/10.** The first run was cut off by the usage limit, so I reran it with a new tester. Final scores across five rounds: 5, 6, 5, 6, 6. The post and REVIEW.md state these honestly, including that round 5's fixes shipped after its score.\n\nRound 5's fixes are live as 75ed2a7:\n- The demo shows \"You: Fuego, the host\" or \"You: Amor, a friend\" on every step.\n- New coach lines for the second half: \"Not enough said yes, so it shrank. Tap Find them.\" and \"It points to the bench. Tap I'm here when you arrive.\"\n- In the demo, \"Back to you\" and \"Next\" replace \"Pocket it\".\n- Copy changes: \"Use this\", \"No bench or restroom info here\", \"Host your own\" in the nav, and the home example now names a third friend (\"only if Sam comes\").\n- compass.disclaimer is unchanged because it's a fixed requirement string (SRS-CMP-5).\n- What's still open is logged in docs/research/fresh-eyes-2026-10-11.md.\n\n**Pre-review pass:**\n- **CI:** `npm run ci` passes (secret scan 0, lint, types, 775 tests, contracts, build, budget, 38 diagrams).\n- **Every e2e:** hello, pwa, field 27/27, sparks, loop, telegram, kit a11y 0, demo, plan, voice, flow real 2/2, and site axe 0 on 88 views. After the round-5 changes I re-ran demo, sparks, telegram, plan and flow real: all pass.\n- **Live smoke:** all required checks pass, and the live demo e2e passes. The hub is connected.\n- **check-env:** every setting is set. None of 12 secret values appears in 1,335 tracked files or 374 build files.\n- **scan-sessions --public (dry run):** 0 secrets, but 1,539 email-address and 22 phone-number matches in 101 of 166 checkpoints. The founder decides on the scrub before any session goes public.\n- **docs/post/REVIEW.md:**\n  - the founder's decisions: repo public, the session scrub, DigitalOcean, Google billing, stale folders;\n  - every [FIELD] by line;\n  - the image and video uploads;\n  - the exact DEV publish steps;\n  - the DevRelay agent-session steps;\n  - after-publish checks.\n\nThe post and media are in sync (recaptured after the last changes). main is at origin/main and the working tree is clean apart from the founder's untracked folders. Holding for the founder's 9 PM review; I won't make any more changes to live.","type":"message","recipient":"uds:<socket>","recipient_kind":"session","content":"Round 5 and the pre-review pass are done. I'm hol…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":792859,"output_tokens":1025,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":570,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1025,"cache_read_input_tokens":792859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":570},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01JhSLEREEJ9ofBkRXp2PhP8":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Round 5 fixed, pre-review pass done; holding","message":"Round 5 and the pre-review pass are done. I'm holding for the founder.\n\n**Round 5: 6/10.** The first run was cut off by the usage limit, so I reran it with a new tester. Final scores across five rounds: 5, 6, 5, 6, 6. The post and