{"parentUuid":"5402e0da-4718-4403-a6f6-a04cd91233f8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>11305701 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e707a5be-a18e-4108-97e4-a4032d674823","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:16:14.581Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>11305701 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
{"parentUuid":"e707a5be-a18e-4108-97e4-a4032d674823","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfw9Hy1B1on6ptCB5Bg7c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The last fresh-eyes round is fixed and live, the final checks passed, and I've stopped making changes to the live site until your 9 PM review.\n\n**Fresh-eyes scores:** 5, 6, 5, 6 and 6 out of 10 over five rounds, each with a new tester who had never seen the site. The first run of round 5 was cut off by the usage limit, so I ran it again with a new tester. The post reports these scores as they are, and says round 5's fixes went out after its score was taken.\n\n**What changed after round 5 (live as 75ed2a7):**\n- The demo now always shows whose screen you're on (\"You: Fuego, the host\" or \"You: Amor, a friend\").\n- The second half of the demo has short coaching lines: why the plan shrank, and what to tap on the compass.\n- In the demo, \"Pocket it\" is replaced by \"Back to you\" and \"Next\".\n- Copy changes:\n  - \"Use this\" instead of \"Use these\";\n  - \"No bench or restroom info here\" instead of \"Access unknown here\";\n  - \"Host your own\" instead of \"Run it\" in the site menu;\n  - the home page's example condition now names a third friend.\n\n**Final checks:**\n- The full CI run passes, and so does every end-to-end suite, including the real-stack Plan and Voice Flare runs. Accessibility checks find 0 issues on every page.\n- The live smoke check and the live demo test pass, and the Gemma laptop is connected to the server.\n- No secret from `.env` appears anywhere in the repo or in the website build.\n- **Agent sessions:** the recorded sessions contain no secrets, but they do contain 1,539 email-address matches and 22 phone-number matches, across 101 of the 166 saved sessions. Most are probably your account email, but they need scrubbing before any session is made public. That's your call.\n\n**Your checklist is in `docs/post/REVIEW.md`:**\n- the decisions only you can make: make the repo public, the session scrub, DigitalOcean billing, Google billing, and deleting the two old image folders;\n- every placeholder in the post, by line number;\n- what to upload (screenshots, video, a Sentry trace screenshot);\n- the exact steps to publish on DEV, and to add an agent session through DevRelay.\n\nThe deadline is Mon Oct 12, 06:59 UTC (2:59 AM ET)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_read_input_tokens":793429,"output_tokens":776,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":776,"cache_read_input_tokens":793429,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1196,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1196},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d119ade7-e6f5-46ea-9e31-8eb6df285f07","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw9HwiJ6dKgY73pEG8bj","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a90292b6-e6fb-402d-aae0-bcae23329363","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:16:23.710Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
