r may review what it receives. (`npm run e2e:cloud-only` checks this: Gemma's words for a photo in about 3.4 s, a Plan draft in 1.3 s.)\n3. **Ollama on your own machine.** The private option: the photo never leaves your machine. Start the hub (step 2 below) on a Mac or any machine with a GPU.\n\n`DATABASE_URL=pglite:memory` gives an in-memory Postgres for a quick run.''')\nrep('''**2. The AI hub** (second terminal, on the machine with Ollama)''','''**2. The AI hub, for level 3 only** (second terminal, on the machine with Ollama)''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='package.json'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('''    \"e2e:cloud-only\": \"node apps/web/test/e2e/cloud-only.ts\",''','''    \"e2e:cloud-only\": \"node apps/web/test/e2e/cloud-only.ts\",\n    \"e2e:no-keys\": \"node apps/web/test/e2e/cloud-only.ts --no-keys\",''',1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -i '' 's#(`node apps/web/test/e2e/cloud-only.ts --no-keys` checks this:#(`npm run e2e:no-keys` checks this:#' README.md; grep -n \"^## Host your own copy\" README.md","description":"README: nothing to install, three levels, honest test line"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"481b5018-ba81-45da-8197-50163b5ce5e0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwKFmYy87hJsRiXwgVLc","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b61678a-57d2-406f-adaf-320db6e052a0","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:27:05.318Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
