{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:27:47.177Z","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","content":"<cross-session-message from=\"uds:<socket>\" from-session=\"local_beb3cc8c-e162-46cc-bd0a-f870e8717ebd\" from-name=\"Flare Manager(founders CTO)\" from-mode=\"prompting\">\nNext, after the setup-copy fix, in this order. Clarity for judges comes first, because we're stuck at 6/10.\n\nA. Clarity\n1. Fix the six items left from fresh-eyes round 5:\n   - the third-person host line on your own screen\n   - the suggested park vs the street name\n   - the X on the demo's last screens\n   - the buttons left in the DOM behind the coach card\n   - \"Sent a moment ago\" never updating\n   - the gap above \"What it does\"\n2. The \"What it does\" heading looks faded under the sticky header in 13-site-feature-cards.png. Check it isn't stuck mid-reveal.\n3. Rename the \"Run it\" nav to \"Host your own\", so nobody reads it as a step.\n4. Built with: add Tinker (the measured failure, then rules it taught, 20/40 to 30/40 blind) and Entire. Both are missing from the strip.\n5. Run fresh-eyes round 6 with the same method and no priming. Fix what it finds, and report the score honestly. The target is 8/10.\n\nB. Learns your words, on this phone\nWhen the rules misread a condition and the person picks what they meant on the readback, the phone saves that phrasing to that rule locally and reads it right next time. Nothing is sent, and there's no training server. Delete it with Forget. Then:\n- add tests\n- add a line on the AI page\n- add a short privacy line\n- report a before/after on the blind set using simulated corrections, labeled as simulated\n\nDon't start anything that listens to conversations. Report after A, then after B.\n</cross-session-message>"}
