{"parentUuid":"baa1b318-f67e-436f-ab1c-1fa4eb5ebf9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfwL8FStqVRPmmkCvkZU3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ViK1mzAkmbf4hDBfVCacQG","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"Flare Manager(founders CTO)","summary":"Setup-copy fix live; starting A","message":"The setup-copy fix is live as b6fd014, and live smoke passes.\n\n- **Site:** \"Host your own copy\" is now on the home link, the /run title and the og tags. /run opens with \"Using Flare needs nothing: you open the link, and that's all. This page is only for people who want their own server.\" I also fixed its clone URL to Hotragn/flare; it said flare-outside before.\n- **Three levels** on /run and in the README: no AI keys, a free Google AI Studio key, or Ollama on your own machine. I checked both of the first two on a fresh server with a temp env file:\n  - **Level 2** (only GEMINI_API_KEY, no hub): Ask cloud Gemma wrote \"Peaceful lakeside autumn views\" in 3.4 s, the Flare lit, and a Plan draft came back from the cloud in 1.3 s (`npm run e2e:cloud-only`).\n  - **Level 1** (no keys): typed words, it lit, template steps (`npm run e2e:no-keys`).\n- **App with the laptop off:** \"Tap a place word, or write your own six.\" With the cloud on, it adds \"…or ask cloud Gemma.\" Photos still need the explicit tap. I reworded ai.hubFallback and ai.why.hub_down too.\n- **README:** \"Using Flare needs nothing\" is at the top. The old \"Field test … on four iPhones\" line claimed something that didn't happen; it now says what was actually tested and that there's been no group meetup yet.\n- **Post:** \"Nothing to install. … Gemma runs on our laptop and serves everyone, so you don't need a laptop, a GPU, a key or an account.\" The three levels are in Code.\n- **Gates:** copy lint 0, svelte-check 0, CI, axe 0 (88 views), Lighthouse 100 on 5 pages, and e2e demo/sparks/telegram plus both levels.\n- **No Deploy to Render button:** I couldn't test one without creating something under the founder's account.\n\nStarting A now (round-5 leftovers, the heading check, nav, Built with), then round 6, then B.","type":"message","recipient":"Flare Manager(founders CTO)","recipient_kind":"name","content":"The setup-copy fix is live as b6fd014, and live s…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":825034,"output_tokens":812,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":343,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":812,"cache_read_input_tokens":825034,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":343},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01ViK1mzAkmbf4hDBfVCacQG":{"to":"Flare Manager(founders CTO)","summary":"Setup-copy fix live; starting A","message":"The setup-copy fix is live as b6fd014, and live smoke passes.\n\n- **Site:** \"Host your own copy\" is now on the home link, the /run title and the og tags. /run opens with \"Using Flare needs nothing: you open the link, and that's all. This page is only for people who want their own server.\" I also fixed its clone URL to Hotragn/flare; it said flare-outside before.\n- **Three levels** on /run and in the README: no AI keys, a free Google AI Studio key, or Ollama on your own machine. I checked both of the first two on a fresh server with a temp env file:\n  - **Level 2** (only GEMINI_API_KEY, no hub): Ask cloud Gemma wrote \"Peaceful lakeside autumn views\" in 3.4 s, the Flare lit, and a Plan draft came back from the cloud in 1.3 s (`npm run e2e:cloud-only`).\n  - **Level 1** (no keys): typed words, it lit, template steps (`npm run e2e:no-keys`).\n- **App with the laptop off:** \"Tap a place word, or write your own six.\" With the cloud on, it adds \"…or ask cloud Gemma.\" Photos still need the explicit tap. I reworded ai.hubFallback and ai.why.hub_down too.\n- **README:** \"Using Flare needs nothing\" is at the top. The old \"Field test … on four iPhones\" line claimed something that didn't happen; it now says what was actually tested and that there's been no group meetup yet.\n- **Post:** \"Nothing to install. … Gemma runs on our laptop and serves everyone, so you don't need a laptop, a GPU, a key or an account.\" The three levels are in Code.\n- **Gates:** copy lint 0, svelte-check 0, CI, axe 0 (88 views), Lighthouse 100 on 5 pages, and e2e demo/sparks/telegram plus both levels.\n- **No Deploy to Render button:** I couldn't test one without creating something under the founder's account.\n\nStarting A now (round-5 leftovers, the heading check, nav, Built with), then round 6, then B."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"7a623c6f-14cf-4f77-926a-c621290e597d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfwL8EFTGiQbkhW24xzUy","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0350be23-3471-4c46-89b7-8d5ef6af0c80","timestamp":"2026-10-11T23:38:25.461Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"<project>/flare","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","version":"2.1.295","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"wondrous-tumbling-meteor"}
