{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-12T00:24:14.708Z","sessionId":"904c52d9-f200-4552-8ce5-05e400952efa","content":"<agent-message from=\"a1ac31aa2d2a5e6f7\">\nProgress note on site-motion (website engineer): commit a3e295f on branch site-motion, mergeable now; only (site) routes, new site.*/og-free keys inserted mid-deck, docs/research/why-it-matters-sources.md, a new test file apps/web/test/site/motion.test.ts, and static/site/tg/*.webp.\nHome order now (founder re-plan): hero (+ sunset line from time zone, \"Use my location\" on tap, \"Judging? 60-second tour\") -> Why it matters (4 charts, every number read from primary source: NHAPS 87%/6%, ATUS via Kannan & Veazie 2023 friends 60->34->20 min/day and alone 285->309->333, Gallup-Meta 24% / 27% ages 19-29, White 2019 120 min/week; Surgeon General PDF blocked by hhs.gov 403 so its numbers are NOT used) -> Start in a minute (3 animated mini phones + real Telegram card tap-flip) -> Your crew space (labelled Sample crew, week bars fill, Atlas pins drop) -> Running now (live health + audit, loads near view) -> Try it on your photo (live drafts, PhotoPrint, typed fallback, cloud only on tap if config allows) -> scroll story (native scroll timeline, rAF fallback, stepped under reduced motion; also on /how/ replacing the static shrink states) -> At the spot rail (compass with \"Hear the compass\" ElevenLabs clips on tap, loop, Sparks; Remember this / Sounds of the spot dropped). /how/ gets Under the hood with partner numbers and repo links. View transitions between site pages.\nPassing so far: copy-lint 0 problems; svelte-check 0/0; biome 0 errors (10 pre-existing warnings in site.css/app.css); npm test passes; axe 0 findings, 0 targets under 44 px. Lighthouse spot run (1 run, / and /how/): all 100 except mobile home perf 99 (LCP 2.0 s) — tuning now, then full 5-page x 2-form run, budget, 4x-CPU scroll trace, reduced-motion shots, before/after shots and GIF.\nNote: the title is \"Running now\", not \"Right now\": copy-lint bans \"right now\" as fake urgency.\n</agent-message>"}
